11.9
22-Jul-2026

* Poor link indication: configurable screen-edge warning (colour outline with
  smooth gradient + corner vignette, or black bars) driven by live link quality
* Manual white balance for OpenIPC/waybeam cameras: colour-temperature lock
  (2500-8000K) with live-updating slider, plus Auto
* Recording source selector (Ground / Onboard SD / Both) with reliable
  first-recording start
* Fixed OpenIPC vehicle radio frequency never being set on boot (drone stuck
  on 2.4GHz channel 1) - uses iw instead of iwconfig
* Fixed spurious "command not understood by vehicle" popup when recording
* Various bug fixes surfaced by -Wall -Wextra and Makefile dependency tracking
